From 3c85577464caacfe539b97a7838170934d93591b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 19:09:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign AboutPage as the Fleet Tracker homepage

Brand-led hero with Datavera Analytics lockup and a parallaxing SVG
mining survey graphic, an "Explore the platform" module grid, a
Platform modules roadmap panel, a Why Datavera section, and a
Datavera brand + footer panel. Same props signature and NAV keys as
before, so routing, Supabase logic, site context and permissions are
unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
